   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     13
    ],
    "text": "exit — terminate a process",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_130_02\" id=\"tag_17_130_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/stdlib.h.html\">stdlib.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nvoid exit(int</tt> <i>status</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_130_03\" id=\"tag_17_130_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]exit[/I5]() function shall cause normal process termination to occur. No functions registered by the [A6][I7]at_quick_exit[/I7]()[/A6] function shall be called. If a process calls the [I8]exit[/I8]()\nfunction more than once, or calls the [A9][I10]quick_exit[/I10]()[/A9] function in addition to the\n[I11]exit[/I11]() function, the behavior is undefined.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A6": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/at_quick_exit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I8": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A9": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/quick_exit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I10": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I11": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The value of [I12]status[/I12] can be 0, EXIT_SUCCESS, EXIT_FAILURE, [S13][[A14]CX[/A14]][/S13]\n[IMG15] &nbsp;or any other value, though only the least significant 8\nbits (that is, [I16]status[/I16] & 0377) shall be available from [A17][I18]wait[/I18]()[/A17] and [A19][I20]waitpid[/I20]()[/A19]; the full value shall be available from [A21][I22]waitid[/I22]()[/A21] and in the [B23]siginfo_t[/B23] passed to a signal handler for SIGCHLD. [IMG24]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I12": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "S13": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A14": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG15": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "I16": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A17": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/wait.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I18": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A19": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/waitpid.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I20": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A21": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/waitid.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I22": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "B23": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG24": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\">"
     }
    },
