   },
   {
    "id": "p_00008",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The [I25]exit[/I25]() function shall first call all functions registered by [A26][I27]atexit[/I27]()[/A26],\nin the reverse order of their registration, except that a function is called after any previously registered functions that had\nalready been called at the time it was registered. Each function is called as many times as it was registered. If, during the call\nto any such function, a call to the [A28][I29]longjmp[/I29]()[/A28] function is made that would terminate\nthe call to the registered function, the behavior is undefined.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I25": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A26": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/atexit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I27": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A28": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/longjmp.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I29": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00009",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     9
    ],
    "text": "If a function registered by a call to [A30][I31]atexit[/I31]()[/A30] fails to return, the remaining\nregistered functions shall not be called and the rest of the [I32]exit[/I32]() processing shall not be completed.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A30": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/atexit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I31": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I32": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00010",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     11
    ],
    "text": "The [I33]exit[/I33]() function shall then flush all open streams with unwritten buffered data. [S34][[A35]CX[/A35]][/S34] [IMG36] For each stream\nwhich is the active handle to its underlying file descriptor, and for which the file is not already at EOF and is capable of\nseeking, the file offset of the underlying open file description shall be set to the file position of the stream. For each open\nstream, the [I37]exit[/I37]() function shall perform the equivalent of a [A38][I39]close[/I39]()[/A38] on the\nfile descriptor that is associated with the stream. [IMG40] Finally, the\nprocess shall be terminated [S41][[A42]CX[/A42]][/S41] [IMG43] &nbsp;with the same consequences as described in [A44][I45]Consequences of Process Termination[/I45]()[/A44]. [IMG46]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I33": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "S34": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A35": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG36": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "I37": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A38": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/close.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I39": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG40": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-end.gif\" alt=\"[Option End]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "S41": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A42": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG43": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
     "A44": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/_Exit.html#tag_17_02_03_01\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I45": {
